{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q23668732","formula":"C₂₆H₂₃N₇O₂","hill":"C26H23N7O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":26.0,"H":23.0,"N":7.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Acalabrutinib","uk":"Акалабрутиніб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Acalabrutinib, sold under the brand name Calquence, is an anti-cancer medication used to treat various types of non-Hodgkin lymphoma, including mantle cell lymphoma and chronic lymphocytic leukemia/small lymphocytic lymphoma. It may be used both in relapsed as well as in treatment-naive settings. Common side effects include headaches, feeling tired, low red blood cells, low platelets, and low white blood cells.","uk":"Акалабрутиніб англ. Acalabrutinib, лат. Acalabrutinibum) — синтетичний лікарський препарат, який належить до групи інгібіторів інгібіторів протеїнтирозинкінази, та поширюється під торговою назвою «Калькуенс», який застосовується для лікування неходжкінської лімфоми та мантійноклітинної лімфоми."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":71226662,"mass":465.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC#CC(=O)N1CCC[C@H]1C2=NC(=C3N2C=CN=C3N)C4=CC=C(C=C4)C(=O)NC5=CC=CC=N5","inchikey":"WDENQIQQYWYTPO-IBGZPJMESA-N","iupac":"4-[8-amino-3-[(2S)-1-but-2-ynoylpyrrolidin-2-yl]imidazo[1,5-a]pyrazin-1-yl]-N-pyridin-2-ylbenzamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"71226662","atoms":58,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-7.415,"y":1.862,"z":3.464,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.713,"y":1.089,"z":2.441,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.136,"y":0.446,"z":1.605,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.441,"y":-0.333,"z":0.6,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.541,"y":-1.554,"z":0.631,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.717,"y":0.346,"z":-0.35,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.688,"y":1.79,"z":-0.521,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.75,"y":2.034,"z":-1.693,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.845,"y":0.737,"z":-2.494,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.017,"y":-0.347,"z":-1.422,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.